{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"全忠实函子"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"全忠实函子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>全忠实函子</strong> (fully faithful functor) 又称<strong>全子范畴</strong> (full subcategory), 是满足如下条件的函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$: 对任意对象 $X,Y\\in\\mathcal C$, 映射 $\\mathcal C(X,Y) \\to \\mathcal D(F(X),F(Y))$ 为等价.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 全忠实函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ 必为"},{"Local":{"url":"子范畴","text":"子范畴"}},{"Plain":", 即 $F$ 给出"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"单射","text":"单射"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C^{\\simeq} \\to \\mathcal D^{\\simeq}$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>全忠实函子"},{"Local":{"url":"反映(范畴论)","text":"反映"}},{"Plain":"极限和余极限.</p>\n"}]}}